    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About SigKi</string>
    <string name="about_description">SigKi is a combination of \u0022Sig\u0022 (Signal) and \u0022Ki\u0022 (the sound made by the Peregrine Falcon, the fastest flying animal). \n\nIt symbolizes the instant possibilities triggered by a quick signal from your phone. By taking over the standard assistant invocation, SigKi replaces generic AI chatbots with lightning-fast access to the tools you actually use every day.</string>
